Origin
------
This repository contains the TypeScript source of OpenTeam v1.0.3 (commit
8ef6f37e5fb070c9cb3fb2217837bb4aba2c27d2), modified to create Themis. The
upstream repository is linked above.

Changes made in Themis (2026)
-----------------------------
- Renamed the product, storage keys and internal identifiers from OpenTeam to Themis.
- Removed the local CLI control client (the websocket link to an external
  "OpenTeam CLI" daemon) and its settings.
- Translated the built-in persona library, team templates and remaining
  Chinese interface text into English.
- Added file attachments in the composer (pick, paste, drag and drop), a side
  file viewer (images, video, audio, PDF, Markdown, DOCX and plain text) and
  delivery of attached files to each AI site.
- Added an optional step that deletes a chat's conversations on the AI sites
  when the chat is deleted.
- Redesigned parts of the interface: neutral color theme, shared message and
  composer column, chat list grouped by date, and assorted fixes.
- Added automated tests for the above.

